      ],
      "Price": 829,
      "Featured": true,
      "Description": "> \"The Tideline came out of a run of boards we kept shaping shorter and wider for the same rider — surfers who wanted their shortboard to still paddle like something bigger. It's got a touch more foam through the chest than a standard performance blank, pulled back through a tighter round tail so it never feels like you're riding a barge. Under your front foot it's got a single-to-double concave feeding into a vee out the tail, so it releases clean off the top without feeling nervous underfoot. This is the board I hand a strong intermediate who's ready to stop fighting their equipment and start surfing it.\"\n>\n> — House Shaper, WESTLINE",
